<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Hello,&nbsp;</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style=""><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Your account is past due&nbsp;</font><font face="arial">{!Case.Past_Due_Balance__c}</font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">. Are you in the position to get any of this caught up at this time</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">?</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">We can run as a lump sum or split up the balance to run on days of your choice. Please let us know which you prefer.</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Note: Please respond directly to this email and do not remove any of the contents. Any payment ran past date of maturity carries an additional $10 per day fee. **Fee will be waived if your modification was due to a natural disaster**</font></p></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thank you,&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!Case.OwnerFullName}<font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium;">&nbsp;|&nbsp;</font>{!Case.OwnerTitle}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial"><b>{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}</b></font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">P: {!Case.OwnerPhone}&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium;">E:&nbsp;</span>{!Case.OwnerEmail}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="" size="1">{!Case.Email_Thread_ID__c}</font></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>